---
// Who Benefits section of the home page: an accordion with one item per audience.
// The item itself (markup, opening and closing) comes from src/components/Accordion.astro.
// The look of this section is set here.
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Accordion from '../Accordion.astro';
import b2bSaasIcon from '../../assets/home/who-benefits/b2b-saas.svg';
import startupsSmbsIcon from '../../assets/home/who-benefits/startups-smbs.svg';
---

<div class="who">
  <div class="who__list">
    <Accordion id="benefits-b2b-saas" title="B2B SaaS" headingTag="h2" data-reveal>
      <Image slot="icon" src={b2bSaasIcon} alt="benefits b2b saas icon" loading="lazy" />
      <p>
        Wristband can be used to implement many styles of authentication; however, it&rsquo;s primarily designed for B2B
        SaaS applications whose users authenticate as employees of an organization rather than as individual consumers.
        For these types of applications, Wristband&rsquo;s support for features such as multi-tenancy, single sign-on
        (SSO), and role-based access control (RBAC) provide the most value. Examples of such applications include:
      </p>
      <ul role="list" class="who__examples">
        <li>Project management and productivity tools</li>
        <li>HR systems</li>
        <li>Finance and legal applications</li>
        <li>Cybersecurity tools</li>
        <li>E-Commerce and marketplace platforms</li>
        <li>Sales and Marketing tech</li>
        <li>EdTech</li>
      </ul>
    </Accordion>
    <Accordion id="benefits-startups-smbs" title="Startups & SMBs" headingTag="h2" data-reveal>
      <Image slot="icon" src={startupsSmbsIcon} alt="benefits startup smbs icon" loading="lazy" />
      <p>
        Wristband is committed to providing companies of all sizes with the tools they need to secure their
        application&rsquo;s identities. &nbsp;We believe that security is an essential right rather than a luxury item.
        As such, all of Wristband&rsquo;s security features are available on the free tier. &nbsp;Even if you&rsquo;re
        just starting to build your application, you&rsquo;ll still have access to advanced capabilities such as MFA and
        SSO. With Wristband, your application can have enterprise level authentication from day one.
      </p>
    </Accordion>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .who {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .who__list {
    --accordion-bg: #f5f5f5;
    --accordion-shadow: 1px 4px 10px 1px #14142b17;
    --accordion-title-size: 24px;
    --accordion-title-color: var(--palette-charcoal);
    --accordion-arrow-color: var(--palette-charcoal);

    display: flex;
    flex-flow: column;
    gap: 40px;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 40px auto 0;
  }

  .who__examples {
    display: flex;
    flex-flow: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }
</style>
